  "reasoning": "The defendant stole two motorcycles by breaking into homes, which constitutes theft (盗窃). He also sold the stolen motorcycles, which involves concealment of stolen property and its proceeds, matching the crime of 掩饰、隐瞒犯罪所得、犯罪所得收益. Later, he poured agricultural chemicals (pesticides) into the village water source, an act of introducing dangerous substances that endangers public safety, fitting the offense of 投放危险物质罪 (dangerous substance endangerment). Therefore, three crimes apply.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]盗窃;掩饰、隐瞒犯罪所得、犯罪所得收益;投放危险物质罪<eoa>"
